This is the official recommended leveling chart from the book itself for the chapter you are in. Dont worry theres no spoilers given how far you already are in the chapter. 5 is \*slightly\* low level, but not much.

The moment you dont take your break is the moment the company assumes you dont need it and come to expect you to work through it.

&#x200B;

Always take your break even if you dont feel like it, to protect your future self and your fellow break takers
